<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Wila Unogile</para>
  <para style="toc1">Wila Unogile Kufosa Nyila Zose</para>
  <para style="toc2">Wila Unogile</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wila</para>
  <para style="mt">Wila Unogile Kufosa Nyila Zose</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Wila Unogile Kufosa Nyila Zose china nyila za Chiyahudi za kuilonda mulume na muke. Yodahika chandikigwa na wanhu wengi mbasakanyo. Kwa ulonzi wa Chiebulania chitabu chino chotangigwa, “Wila wa Nyila” fambulo jake wila unogile kufosa nyila zose. Chitabu chokwandusa kumtambula mfalume Sulemani (sula ya 1:1) mbali hachilagusa kuwa yeye iyo yandike. Yodahika chitabu chino chandikigwa na munhu imwenga yailungile kumtogoza mfalume Sulemani. Wasomi hawavimanyile chitabu icho chandikigwa zuwaki, mbali yodahika chandikigwa hagati ya mwaka 970 KK na 931 KK, Sulemani viyakalile mfalume.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Wila Unogile Kufosa Nyila Zose china nhogolwa za kuilonda mulume na muke. Muna ichitabu chino mulume na muke woilongela hamu zawo. Iviya wambwiya wa mulume na muke woilumba hamwe nawo kudeng'helela kuilonda kwawo (sula ya 1:8). Wasomi wengi woitogolela kuwa usenga mkulu wa chitabu chino wopatika muna isula ya 8:5-7. Muna imistali iyo muke kolonga kuwa kuilonda kuna nguvu kufosa ifa. Ifa yabule uhelelo iviya kuilonda kwabule uhelelo. Icho ichimu cha muke kuwazuma wamwenga miyanza mitatu kuwa sekewasongeze kuilonda lung'hali lusita lwake halunafika (sula ya 2:7 na sula ya 3:5 na sula ya 8:4).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Muna isula ya 1:1 zina da chitabu dotambuligwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Dahamala zina da chitabu, wila wa mwanduso wopatika muna isula ya 1:2 mbaka sula ya 2:7.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Wila wekaidi wopatika muna isula ya 2:8 mbaka sula ya 3:5.</para>
  <para style="ip">4. Wila weketatu wopatika muna isula ya 3:6 mbaka sula ya 5:1.</para>
  <para style="ip">5. Wila wekane wopatika muna isula ya 5:2 mbaka sula ya 6:3.</para>
  <para style="ip">6. Wila wetano wopatika muna isula ya 6:4 mbaka sula ya 8:4.</para>
  <para style="ip">7. Wila wa kugotola wopatika muna isula ya 8:5 mbaka sula ya 8:14.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="SNG 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 1:1" />Wila wa Solomoni unogile kufosa nyila zose.<verse eid="SNG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila wa mwanduso</para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 1:2" />Nokulamba uninonele kwa mulomo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:2">kwaviya kunilonda kwako kunoga kufosa divai.<verse eid="SNG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 1:3" />Mavuta yako yonung'hila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">zina jako dilinga fana mavuta yonung'hila goya yagidigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">lekamana mhambe wokulonda.<verse eid="SNG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 1:4" />Uniwinze, chihite himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">mfalume wangu unigale muna iviheleto vako.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 1:4">Mbwiya wolonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Chizadeng'helela na kusekelela hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">kunilonda kwako kunoga kufosa divai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Sazanywa kuwona mhambe wokulonda!<verse eid="SNG 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 1:5" />Mweye mhambe wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">niye na mtitu na ninoga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">Nilinga fana mahema ya Kedali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">nilinga fana mapanzia ya Sulemani.<verse eid="SNG 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 1:6" />Sekemunilole kwaviya namtitu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">kwaviya zuwa dinisoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Wana wa mami yangu waniwonela ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">wanika niwe mkalizi wa migunda ya mizabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Mbali mgunda wangu wa mizabibu siukalize.<verse eid="SNG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 1:7" />Lelo nilongele weye yonikulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">ng'hondolo wako kowadima kulihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">Vino ng'hondolo wako wezahumula kulihi ihafika imisi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">Vino habali nikuzahile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">muna yamabumbila ya wayago?<verse eid="SNG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mulume kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 1:8" />One huvimanyile weye muke lumondo kufosa wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">sondelela mapaga ya ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">na udime wanaluti wako, habehi na mahema ya wadimaji.<verse eid="SNG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 1:9" />Weye nyachende wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:9">nokulinganyiza na falasi zike hagati ya falasi walume wobulula matololi ya mfalume wa Misili.<verse eid="SNG 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 1:10" />Makanza yako yahambigwa vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:10">singo yako yonogeza kwa mikufu ya mabwe ya hela nyingi.<verse eid="SNG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 1:11" />Chizakutendela heleni za zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:11">zihambigwe na hela.<verse eid="SNG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 1:12" />Mfalume wangu viyakalile muna dikomwa jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:12">mnung'ho wa mavuta yangu yonung'hila goya yenela chila hanhu.<verse eid="SNG 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 1:13" />Weye kumwangu kulinga fana chigelo cha ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:13">chikigwa hagati ya matombo yangu.<verse eid="SNG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 1:14" />Weye yonikulonda, kulinga fana maluwa ya hina yokwalika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:14">cholawa kuna imigunda ya mizabibu ya Engedi.<verse eid="SNG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mulume kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 1:15" />Weye yonikulonda, chihanga chako chinoga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:15">Meso yako yanoga fana huwa!<verse eid="SNG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 1:16" />Weye yonikulonda, kweli chihanga chako chinoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">mayani mabisi yezakuwa komwa jetu,<verse eid="SNG 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 1:17" />mibiki ya mielezi izakuwa mhanda za kaye yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:17">mibiki ya mibeloshi izakuwa gulu jake.<verse eid="SNG 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="SNG 2" />
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 2:1" />Niye nilinga fana luwa da kudibawe da Shaloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:1">nilinga fana vibesa muna dibawe.<verse eid="SNG 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mulume kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 2:2" />Fana luwa da chibesa muna ya mibiki ya miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:2">niivo viyeli nyachende wangu hana iwamhambe wamwenga.<verse eid="SNG 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 2:3" />Fana mibiki ya matunda kuna mbago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">niivo viyeli yonimulonda hana iwalume wamwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">Nodeng'helela kukala hasi ya sisila jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">tunda jake damulile ng'hani kumwangu.<verse eid="SNG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 2:4" />Kanigala mbaka kuna ichiheleto cha dugila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:4">na kakweza bendela ya kuilonda uchanyha yangu.<verse eid="SNG 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 2:5" />Muning'he zabibu zinyalile mbaka nigute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">munitende niyadeng'helele matunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">nomulonda mbaka nolegela.<verse eid="SNG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 2:6" />Ditwi jangu digonela mkono wa kumoso wa ija yonimulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:6">na mkono wake wa kulume unihagatila.<verse eid="SNG 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 2:7" />Nomulambani muilahe, mweye mhambe wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">muilahe kwa mhala hebu nhohe wa mchuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">kuwa hamwizakong'hela hebu kulamusa kuilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">mbaka lusita lwake vondalufike.<verse eid="SNG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila wekaidi</para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 2:8" />Nohulika dizi da munhu yonimulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">lola kokwiza yokimbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">kozumha milima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">vilima kovifosa himahima.<verse eid="SNG 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 2:9" />Yonimulonda kalinga fana mhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">kalinga fana nhohe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">Kokwima habehi na ng'huta yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">kosungulila muna dizonzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">kololela muna dipanzia.<verse eid="SNG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 2:10" />Ija yonimulonda kanilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:10">“Winuke weye nyachende wangu, lumondo wangu wize chihite.<verse eid="SNG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 2:11" />Lusita lwa mbeho lufosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:11">na mvula imala kutonya.<verse eid="SNG 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 2:12" />Maluwa yalika chila hanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">lusita lwa kwimba lufika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">madizi ya huwa yohulikika muna iisi yetu.<verse eid="SNG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 2:13" />Mibiki ya nhini yandusa kwima na mizabibu yalika, yonung'hila goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">Winuke weye nyachende wangu, lumondo wangu wize chihite.”<verse eid="SNG 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mulume kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 2:14" />“Weye huwa wangu muna yamafiso ya luwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">uli kuna yamatuka muna imilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">lelo nichiwone chihanga chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">na kuhulika dizi jako, kwaviya dizi jako dinoga na chihanga chako chonogeza.”<verse eid="SNG 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 2:15" />Muchigwilile mbwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:15">waja mbwizi weli wadododo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:15">wobananga mizabibu yetu ikwalika.<verse eid="SNG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 2:16" />Yonimulonda wangu na niye wake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:16">Yeye kodima bumbila jake kuna ivibesa.<verse eid="SNG 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 2:17" />Mbaka zuwa vijalika imitondo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">na masisila vondayasegele imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">weye yonikulonda, unibwelele fana mhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">fana nhohe mdodo uchanyha ya milima mitali.<verse eid="SNG 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="SNG 3" />
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 3:1" />Ichilo vinigonile mudikomwa jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">nimzahila ija yonimulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">nimzahila mbali simpatile.<verse eid="SNG 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 3:2" />Nilamuka na nigendagenda muna dibululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">na muna zinzila na hanhu ha kwiiting'hanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">kuno nomzahila ija yonimulonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">Nimzahila mbali simpatile.<verse eid="SNG 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 3:3" />Wakalizi wa bululu waniwona viwakalile wozunguluka muna dibululu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:3">Baho niwauza, “Vino mweye mumuwona yonimulonda?”<verse eid="SNG 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 3:4" />Lusita ludodo viniwalekile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">nimuwona ija yonimulonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">Nimwamhisa na simulekese</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">mbaka vinimgalile kuna ikaye ya mami yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">muna ichiheleto cha mwanamke yanyeleke.<verse eid="SNG 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 3:5" />Nomulambani muilahe, mweye mhambe wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">muilahe kwa mhala hebu nhohe wa mchuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">kuwa hamwizakong'hela hebu kulamusa kuilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">mbaka lusita lwake vondalufike.<verse eid="SNG 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila weketatu</para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 3:6" />Yelihi iyo yokwiza kulawa kwiichuwala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">Kalinga fana mhanda za yosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">konung'hila manemane na ubani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">na mavuta yose yanogile yochuuzigwa na wachuuzi.<verse eid="SNG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 3:7" />Lola Sulemani, kopapigwa kuna ichigoda chake cha chifalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:7">kozungulukigwa na wakalizi malongo sita, magalu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="SNG 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 3:8" />Chila imwe wawo kamhisa zele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">chila imwe wawo galu wa kuitowa ng'hondo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">Chila imwe wawo kana zele jake mchigudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">waisasala kwa kuitowa ng'hondo na wehi ichilo.<verse eid="SNG 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 3:9" />Mfalume Sulemani kaitendela chigoda cha kupapiligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:9">kwa mbao za mibiki inogile kulawa uko Lebanoni.<verse eid="SNG 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 3:10" />Mhanda zake kazitenda kwa hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">hanhu ha kusigamila hahakigwa zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">chigoda chigubikigwa na vitambala va langi ya zamablau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">mgati muhambigwa na mhambe wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">muladi kulagusa kulonda kwawo.<verse eid="SNG 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 3:11" />Lelo mwize mweye mhambe wa mulima Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">uli muna dibululu da Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">mwize mumulole mfalume Sulemani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">Kavala kombelo diyayawazigwe na mami yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">siku iyo viyasolile muke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">moyo wake udeng'helela.<verse eid="SNG 3:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="SNG 4" />
  <para style="sp">Mulume kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 4:1" />Kweli chihanga chako chinoga, weye nyachende wangu, kweli chihanga chako chinoga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">Meso yako yalinga fana mahuwa, mgati ya gubiko jako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">Nyele zako zilinga fana viya bumbila da luti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">wohumuluka kulawa kuna imilima ya Gileadi.<verse eid="SNG 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 4:2" />Meno yako mazelu fana bumbila da ng'hondolo dikanhigwe mazoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">meno yako yela fana viya bumbila da ng'hondolo wowolawa kuna yamazi kogezigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">chila zino dina miyage fana viya ng'hondolo wolela mbasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">na hupuwa zino dimwe.<verse eid="SNG 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 4:3" />Milomo yako ilinga fana lusingija ludung'hu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">na mulomo wako unoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">na makanza yako yalinga fana viya vihande vidi va komamanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">mgati ya gubiko yako.<verse eid="SNG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 4:4" />Singo yako ilinga fana viya mhanda ya Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">yoisimikigwa kwa kukaliza via va ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">ngao 1,000 zitumbikigwa baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">zose za magalu.<verse eid="SNG 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 4:5" />Matombo yako yalinga fana wana mhala waidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:5">fana viya woidima hagati ya vibesa.<verse eid="SNG 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 4:6" />Mbaka zuwa disomoze na masisila yakimbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">nizagona habehi na matombo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">yalingile fana milima igubikigwe na mavuta yonung'hila goya.<verse eid="SNG 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 4:7" />Weye nyachende wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:7">kunoga ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:7">kunoga kunda na kumgongo.<verse eid="SNG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 4:8" />Weye mhambe wangu izo kumwangu kulawa Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">na chiileke kutali iyo milima ya Lebanoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">Humuluka kulawa kuludonho lwa mulima wa Amana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">kulawa kuludonho lwa mulima wa Senili na Helimoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">kulawa matuka ya simba, iviya kuna imilima yowokala duma.<verse eid="SNG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 4:9" />Mndele wangu kuusangalaza moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">mhambe wangu kuusangalaza moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">kwa kunilola mwanza umwe muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">na kwa usalu umwe wa mkufu wako wouvalile mwiisingo.<verse eid="SNG 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 4:10" />Mndele wangu, mhambe wangu lola, kunilonda kwako kunoga kufosa divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">mavuta yako yonung'hila goya, kufosa vilungo vose.<verse eid="SNG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 4:11" />Mhambe wangu, mulomo wako wolagaza umulile fana lala da uki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">maziwa na uki va hasi ya lulimi lwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">Viwalo vako vonung'hila goya fana vilungo va Lebanoni.<verse eid="SNG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 4:12" />Mhambe wangu, mndele wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">weye niiyo chizi chiidumwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">weye niiyo nzasa izingigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">weye niiyo nzokwe yangu iidumwe.<verse eid="SNG 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 4:13" />Mizukila yako ilinga fana vizi va makomamanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">vili na matunda yanogile kufosa yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">na hina na mavuta yonung'hila goya,<verse eid="SNG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 4:14" />na mkegeni na mchai na mdalasini na ubani na udi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">na vilungo vose vimwenga vili na mnung'ho unogile.<verse eid="SNG 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 4:15" />Weye niiyo nzasa ya chizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">weye niiyo sima da mazi hayanyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">weye niiyo vizanda vikilima kulawa Lebanoni.<verse eid="SNG 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 4:16" />Beho da kasikazi na beho da kusi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">dize dibume uchanyha ya chizi changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">diutende ulanga unhung'he goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">Yeye yonimulonda yeze muna ichizi chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">yalanze matunda yanogile ng'hani.<verse eid="SNG 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="SNG 5" />
  <para style="sp">Mulume kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 5:1" />Nokwingila muna ichizi changu, mndele wangu, mhambe wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">Noduganya manemane na vilungo vinung'hila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">noja lala jangu da uki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">Nong'wa divai yangu na maziwa yangu.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 5:1">Mbwiya wolonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">Muje na mung'we mweye wambwiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">mung'we ng'hani womuilonda.<verse eid="SNG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila wekane</para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 5:2" />Nikala nigonile mbali moyo wangu haugonile mbee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Nihulika yonimulonda kohodiza!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Kolonga, “Univugulile mndele wangu, mhambe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">huwa wangu utelele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Ditwi jangu ditapagala nhungwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">na nyele zangu zipata mawaga ya ichilo.”<verse eid="SNG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 5:3" />Nihambula walo jangu, lelo niyawale kaidi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">Nimala kunawa magulu yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">nizafilaze kaidi?<verse eid="SNG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 5:4" />Maabaho yonimulonda kadalisa lwivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:4">nideng'helela mbaka moyo wangu udinhila kwa ichimu chake.<verse eid="SNG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 5:5" />Ninuka kumvugulila yonimulonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">Makono yangu yamema mavuta ya manemane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">na vidole vangu vilagaza manemane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">nyamhisa mhalalingwe kwa kufungula lwivi.<verse eid="SNG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 5:6" />Nimvugulila lwivi yonimulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">mbali kakala kasegela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Moyo wangu udeng'helela viyakalile kolonga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Nimzahila mbali simpatile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Nimtanga mbali hanidike.<verse eid="SNG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 5:7" />Wakalizi wa bululu wanifika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">viwakalile wozunguluka muna dibululu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">Wanitowa na wanilumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">wakalizi wa ng'huta ya bululu wanihoka walo jangu.<verse eid="SNG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 5:8" />Nowalamba mweye mhambe wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">muhamuwona yonimulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">mulongeleni kumulonda kunitenda nilumwe.<verse eid="SNG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mhambe wa Yelusalemu wolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 5:9" />Weye younogeza kufosa wandele wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">iyo youmulonda kana choni cha kongeza cha wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">mbaka weye uchilambe ivo?<verse eid="SNG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 5:10" />Yonimulonda kanoga na katelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:10">komanyika ng'hani mwa iwawo walume elufu longo.<verse eid="SNG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 5:11" />Ditwi jake dinoga fana zahabu inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:11">nyele zake ziipilinga na nhitu fana howe.<verse eid="SNG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 5:12" />Meso yake yalinga fana ya huwa mumgwazogwazo wa lwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:12">walinga huwa wazelu fana maziwa wowokala mumgwazogwazo wa dilamba.<verse eid="SNG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 5:13" />Makanza yake yalinga fana chizi chimemile vilungo vonung'hila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">Milomo yake ilinga fana vibesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">yolagaza madwende mengi ya manemane.<verse eid="SNG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 5:14" />Makono yake yalinga fana mhete za zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">zozihambigwa mabwe ya bei ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">Lukuli lwake lulinga fana meno ya nhembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">yahambigwe kwa mabwe ya bei ng'hulu yatangigwe samawati.<verse eid="SNG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 5:15" />Magulu yake yalinga fana mhanda za mabwe madala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">zisimikigwe muna ivandusilo va zahabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">Kokwima chigangamavu fana viya mulima wa Lebanoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">fana viya mibiki ya mielezi.<verse eid="SNG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 5:16" />Mulomo wake wamulile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">Yeye konogelwa ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">Tegelezeni mweye mhambe wa Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">niiyo ino yonimulonda na mbwiyangu.<verse eid="SNG 5:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="SNG 6" />
  <para style="sp">Mhambe wa Yelusalemu wolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 6:1" />Weye younogeza kufosa wandele wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">Vino youmulonda kahita kulihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">Kakulihi youmulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">muladi chiumbe na weye kwa kumzahila?<verse eid="SNG 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 6:2" />Yonimulonda kahita kuna ichizi chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">kuna imibiki ya vilungo inung'hila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">muladi kudeng'helela ichizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">na kusola vibesa.<verse eid="SNG 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 6:3" />Niye wa yonimulonda, nayo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:3">yeye kodima bumbila jake kuna ivibesa.<verse eid="SNG 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila wetano</para>
  <para style="sp">Mulume kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 6:4" />Nyachende wangu chihanga chako chinoga fana bululu da Tiliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">konogeza fana Yelusalemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">kodeng'heleza fana watowang'hondo weli na bendela.<verse eid="SNG 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 6:5" />Nokulamba sekeunilole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">kwaviya meso yako yanogeza ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">Nyele zako zilinga fana bumbila da luti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">wohumuluka kuna imilima ya Gileadi.<verse eid="SNG 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 6:6" />Meno yako mazelu fana viya bumbila da ng'hondolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">wowolawa kuna yamazi kogezigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">chila zino dina miyage fana viya ng'hondolo wolela mbasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">na hupuwa hata zino dimwe.<verse eid="SNG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 6:7" />Makanza yako yalinga fana vihande vidi va komamanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:7">mgati ya gubiko yako.<verse eid="SNG 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 6:8" />Hana nyang'ongwe malongo sita na wanaake wadodo malongo manane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">na wandele hawapeteka!<verse eid="SNG 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 6:9" />Mbali habule yeli fana huwa wangu yatelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">mwana wa chike yaidumwe kwa mami yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">Niiyo yopendeleigwa na mami yake yamweleke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">Wandele womulola na womtanga yotemeligwa mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">nyang'ongwe na wake iwadodo womtogoza.<verse eid="SNG 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 6:10" />Vino ino yelihi yalingile fana mhwani yau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">kanoga fana mwezi na kumelemeta fana zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">na kodeng'heleza fana watowang'hondo weli na bendela?<verse eid="SNG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 6:11" />Ningila muna ichizi cha mibiki ikwima matunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">kulola masukila muna dikolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">kulola fana mizabibu yokwalika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">na fana mikomamanga yalika maluwa.<verse eid="SNG 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 6:12" />Ning'hali sinavimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:12">hamu yangu inika muludonho lwa matololi ya chifalume yobululigwa na falasi.<verse eid="SNG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 6:13" />Weye Mshulami bwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">ubwele muladi chikulole.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="SNG 6:13" />
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">Vino molonda kumulola mwanamke Mshulami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:13">fana kulola mabumbila maidi ya watowang'hondo viyovina?<verse eid="SNG 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="SNG 7" />
  <para style="sp">Mulume kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 7:1" />Weye mndele wa mwana wa mfalume, lola magulu yako yanogile viivala vilatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">magulu yako yanogile yalinga fana viya mabwe ya bei ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">sang'hano isang'hanigwe na fundi galu.<verse eid="SNG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 7:2" />Kuvu jako dilinga fana hamha hadiswela divai ihanganyigwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">Munda wako waubulunge fana bugulu da ngano dizungulusigwe vibesa.<verse eid="SNG 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 7:3" />Matombo yako yalinga fana wana mhala waidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">mambasa wa mhala.<verse eid="SNG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 7:4" />Singo yako nhali fana mhanda ya meno ya nhembo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">meso yako yalinga fana malamba ya Heshiboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">habehi na lwivi lwa bululu da Besilabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">mhula yako ima fana mhanda ya Lebanoni ilozile Damasiki.<verse eid="SNG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 7:5" />Ditwi jako dilinga fana mulima wa Kalimeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">nyele zili muna iditwi jako zitililika ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">mfalume kanogelwa nazo.<verse eid="SNG 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 7:6" />Weye yonikulonda kunoga ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:6">koninogela.<verse eid="SNG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 7:7" />Utali wako ulinga fana viya mtende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:7">na matombo yako yalinga fana viya vipambo va matunda.<verse eid="SNG 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 7:8" />Nilonga, “Nizauhanda mtende uwo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">na kuyamha matunda yake.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">Matombo yako yalinga fana vipambo va zabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">na mnung'ho wa mhumuzi yako fana mapela,<verse eid="SNG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 7:9" />na mulomo wako fana viya divai inogile.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 7:9">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">Weye yonikulonda, kunonela kwako kwamulile fana divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">voikilima muna imilomo yangu.<verse eid="SNG 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 7:10" />Niye wa yonimulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:10">nayo konimelela mate.<verse eid="SNG 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 7:11" />Weye yonikulonda, izo chihite kuna imigunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:11">chikagone kuna ivibululu.<verse eid="SNG 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 7:12" />Chilopole kuhita kuna imigunda ya mizabibu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">chilole fana mzabibu walika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">na maluwa yake yagubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">chilole fana mikomamanga ilava maluwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">uko nizakulonda.<verse eid="SNG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 7:13" />Maluwa yolava mnung'ho unogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">na matunda yanogile yotinga uchanyha yetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">matunda ya sambi na matunda ya umwaka ya chila modeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">yonikwikile yonikulonda.<verse eid="SNG 7:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="SNG 8" />
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 8:1" />Weye one uwile sekulu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">wong'hile matombo ya mami yangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">One nihakuting'hane uko kunze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">nihakulamse na habule munhu wa kunizeha.<verse eid="SNG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 8:2" />Nihakulangulize na kukugala muna ikaye ya mami yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">mami yangu iyo yanifunzile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">Nihakwing'hile divai inogile ung'we,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">nihakwing'hile mazi ya makomamanga yangu.<verse eid="SNG 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 8:3" />Ditwi jangu digonela mkono wako wa kumoso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:3">mkono wako wa kulume unihagatila.<verse eid="SNG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 8:4" />Mweye mhambe wa Yelusalemu nowalamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">sekemukong'hele hebu kulamusa kuilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">mbaka lusita lwake vondalufike.<verse eid="SNG 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za kukomelezela</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 8:5" />Vino yelihi yokwiza kulawa kwiichuwala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">kuno komsigamila nyachende wake?</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 8:5">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">Niye nikulamusa kulawa kuna umbiki wa mpela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">uko mami yako viyapatile wimo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">uko kalumwa usungu kakuvumbula.<verse eid="SNG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 8:6" />Unitowe fana muhuli muna umoyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">na fana muhuli muna umkono wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">kwaviya kuilonda kokala siku zose fana ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">na wivu wake wokwamha wanhu fana leme.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">Milambi yake yolunguza fana milambi ya moto.<verse eid="SNG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 8:7" />Mazi mengi hayadaha kuzima kuilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">na nyanda hazidaha kusegeza kuilonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">One munhu yahageza kugula kuilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">na kulava vinhu vake vose kwa ichimu chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">kezazehigwa muhala.<verse eid="SNG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 8:8" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">8:8 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Muna ulonzi wa Chiebulania haimanyika yelihi yolonga muna umsitali wa nane na kenda.</char>
    </note>China lumbu mdodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">matombo yake hayanamema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">Ivo chizatenda choni siku yondayasoligwe?<verse eid="SNG 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 8:9" />One yahawile ng'huta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">chahamzengele mhanda ya hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">na one yahawile lwivi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">chihamzingile mibiki ya mielezi.<verse eid="SNG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 8:10" />Niye nikala nabule matombo fana ng'huta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">mbali sambi mhambaga yangu iwa na matombo fana mhanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">Ivo niwa kuulongozi wa yonimulonda fana munhu yotenda nideng'helele.<verse eid="SNG 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 8:11" />Sulemani kakala na mgunda wa mizabibu uko Baali Hamoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">Kazimisha mgunda uwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">na chila munhu kaliha vihande 1,000 va hela kwa matunda yake.<verse eid="SNG 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 8:12" />Mbali mgunda wangu wa mizabibu nodaha kuulava niye mwenyewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">Sulemani, weye uli na vihande 1,000 va hela ni kwa ichimu chako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">na wawo woyakaliza matunda yako weng'higwe vihande magana maidi va hela kulawa umo.<verse eid="SNG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Mulume kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 8:13" />Weye ukala muna ichizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">mbwiya zako wokutegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">lelo nolamba kutegeleza dizi jako.<verse eid="SNG 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="sp">Muke kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 8:14" />Izo ukimbila yonikulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">na weye uwe fana mhala hebu nhohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">uchanyha ya milima ili na vilungo vinung'hila goya.<verse eid="SNG 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 8" />
</usx>